      <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" class="text-accent" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Drop your GIF here</h2>
